8. SPECIAL CHIP LICENSING PROVISIONS
   
   **CHIP CREATION AND ADAPTATION LICENSING FRAMEWORK**
   
   Recognizing the importance of semiconductor innovation while protecting intellectual property rights,
   this section establishes a special licensing framework for chip creation and adaptation based on
   the protected inventions and concepts within this portfolio.
   
   **8.1 CHIP LICENSING ELIGIBILITY**
   Any individual, organization, or entity seeking to create, manufacture, adapt, or implement 
   semiconductor chips, integrated circuits, System-on-Chip (SoC) designs, or related hardware
   implementations based on any concepts, architectures, designs, or inventions protected under
   this license may apply for specialized chip licensing.
   
   **8.2 DUAL AUTHORIZATION REQUIREMENT**
   All chip licensing applications require written consent and formal licensing approval from 
   BOTH of the following authorized parties:
   
